00:39:23.670 --> 00:39:23.870
Okay.
好吧。

901
00:39:24.470 --> 00:39:29.110
Knee pain in women caused by their butts, question mark, the article asks.
文章问道，女性膝盖疼痛是由臀部引起的吗？

